-------------
  Project : agentmemory
  Author  : Rohit Ghumare <ghumare64@gmail.com>
  Repo    : https://github.com/rohitg00/agentmemory
  Version : 0.9.33
  Source  : src/integrations/dsh.ts (compiled to dist/integrations/dsh.mjs)
